a 90-day devotional for men seeking the&nbsp;
heart of God, I explained it this way:

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:58.480
[Psalm 27:1]

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:05.840
Wow, this is amazing.
You know, David was just a man.&nbsp;

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:13.240
Just like you and me.
But God called him a man after my own heart.&nbsp;

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:16.720
Why?
Because he lived within God's will.&nbsp;

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:22.160
He did what God wanted him to do.
He lived according to the Spirit.&nbsp;

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:31.120
So let me ask you, why if you are a child&nbsp;
of the living God, with His Spirit in you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:35.480
who wants to help you, who wants to guide you, who&nbsp;
wants to give you strength to overcome challenges,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:41.400
who wants to lead you in everything you do&nbsp;
- why do you want to carry on and fight the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:45.680
challenges in your own power?
You, a small human being.&nbsp;

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:47.760
So little and tiny.
Temporary.&nbsp;

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:51.960
One day you're here the next you will be gone.
Dead.&nbsp;

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:59.160
We are so small but the God of the universe&nbsp;
wants to help you His Spirit is in you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:05.080
and it is the same spirit that&nbsp;
rose Jesus from the grave.

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:17.760
[Romans 8:11]

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:29.480
Now, if you want to learn more how to grow deeper&nbsp;
and deeper in Christ, to become stronger ... a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:33.720
mature Christian .... to learn what it&nbsp;
means to abide in Him, to fully surrender.&nbsp;

00:18:33.720 --> 00:18:39.000
Oh, there is so much that we&nbsp;
as His children can learn.&nbsp;

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:43.840
You know, the Bible says that we have already&nbsp;
received all spiritual blessings - do you even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:47.760
know what they are?
It is time to grow.&nbsp;

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:51.400
We cannot stay babies in Christ.
Infants in Christ.&nbsp;

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:57.000
We need to grow so that we can become stronger.
If you want to grow and please get my new book,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:59.840
I'll add the information for you in&nbsp;
the video description, and you can also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:02.880
watch these videos here.
And I'll see you there.&nbsp;

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:09.080
And always remember - that God&nbsp;
loves you - and I love you, too.&nbsp;

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:18.760
Life is short, so please do not waste yours.
Bye guys.

